==Lithuanian==

===Etymology===
Ultimately a {{bor|lt|la|acadēmīa|nocap=1}}, itself a [[borrowing]] from {{etyl|grc|lt}} {{m|grc|Ἀκαδημία}}, a grove of trees and gymnasium outside of Athens where [[w:Plato|Plato]] taught; from the name of the supposed former owner of that estate, the [[w:Attica|Attic]] hero [[w:Akademos|Akademos]].

